  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Welmi respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "1. Data Collection",
  "privacyDataContent": "We collect the following information to provide and improve our services:\n\n• Personal data: name, gender, date of birth, height, weight\n• Health data: steps, calories, water intake, weight changes\n• Usage data: app usage statistics, screen views\n• Device information: device model, operating system version\n\nHealth data is collected only with your explicit consent through Health Connect (Android) or HealthKit (iOS).",
  "privacyUsageTitle": "2. How We Use Data",
  "privacyUsageContent": "We use collected data to:\n\n• Generate personalized meal plans and workout programs\n• Track your progress toward health goals\n• Send reminders for water, meals, and workouts\n• Improve the quality of our AI recommendations\n• Ensure app security and prevent abuse",
  "privacyStorageTitle": "3. Data Storage",
  "privacyStorageContent": "All data is stored securely using Supabase (PostgreSQL) with encryption at rest and in transit. Your data is associated with your account and is not accessible to third parties. Data may be stored in data centers located in various regions.",
  "privacySharingTitle": "4. Data Sharing",
  "privacySharingContent": "We do NOT sell, trade, or share your personal data with third parties, except:\n\n• When required by law\n• To protect the rights and safety of Welmi and its users\n• With your explicit consent\n\nWe use third-party services (Supabase, Google, Sentry) that may process data according to their own privacy policies.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "5. Your Rights",
  "privacyRightsContent": "You have the right to:\n\n• View all your data in the app (Profile → Edit)\n• Request deletion of your account and all data\n• Opt out of notifications at any time\n• Disconnect Health Connect at any time\n\nTo delete your data, contact us through the Support section.",
  "privacySecurityContent": "We implement industry-standard security measures:\n\n• Data encryption in transit (TLS/SSL)\n• Data encryption at rest\n• Authentication via Google OAuth\n• Row-Level Security (RLS) in the database\n\nNo method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, but we do our best to protect your information.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "6. Children's Privacy",
  "privacyChildrenContent": "Welmi is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected such information, please contact us immediately.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "7. Changes to This Policy",
  "privacyChangesContent": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted in the app and will take effect upon publication. We recommend checking this page periodically.",
  "privacyLastUpdated": "Last updated: August 2026",
  "contactTitle": "8. Contact",
  "privacyContactContent": "If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:\n\n• Telegram: @welmi_support\n• Email: support@welmi.app",
  
